        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I’ll implement a digit-DP solution for the full input range, test it against the local cases and brute-force checks, then submit it for publication. I noticed one inconsistent test: it expects `94` to count when `k=9`, but `94` is not divisible by `9`.",
